{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30552","headline":"句 · 赵嘏","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮云悲晚翠，落日泣秋风。\n语风双燕立，褭树百劳飞。\n松岛鹤归书信绝，橘洲风起梦魂香。\n徒知六国随斤斧，莫有羣儒定是非。\n一千里色中秋月，十万军声半夜潮。\n梁王旧馆已秋色，珠履少年轻绣衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}